Readout
- Only site 12 is Jacobsthal-admissible under W(v)=[14-v,27-2v].
- AP and GW both pass the basic endpoint/divisibility/unit/apex/gap filters.
- The AP-residue false look-alike passes endpoint residues but fails covering_ok.
- Some formal accelerations duplicate speeds; distinct_speeds filters them before summit use.
- Coarse pressure shells and inner score sequences are too weak; the gate tournament and
  node-squared relative-profile hashes are the discriminators.

